  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Practical Action Research</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Practical action research for enhanced food security and climate resilience in the drylands. The project focuses on increased capacity for collaborative learning among male and female (agro)pastoralists, CSOs and researchers. Multiple actors are engaged in gender-sensitive practical action research.</narrative>
  </description>
